还原 __ia32_sys_file_setattr 之后的全部飞牛 trimvfs 函数和 bss 变量
g_external_disk_access、trim_system_root_*。trim_trashbin() 属于
trim_trashbin.c (另一组还原中), 先放 __weak 桩 fs/trimvfs_stub.c,
那边落地后删掉桩和 Makefile 里的 trimvfs_stub.o。

fcmp (vmlinux, 40 项): 一致 21, 近似 6, 不一致 13 (含缺 .part.0 1 项)
一致: trim_is_on_trashbin_whitelist is_in_team_trashbin_dir_and_return_teamdir_dentry
  is_trimacl may_user_dir_d __d_is_vol_path is_vol is_vol_path_d is_vol_d
  is_str_num posixacl_access_check_acl is_mount_on_vol d_is_vol_path
  trim_is_in_group get_permission vol_is_admin_or_homeowner
  get_team_trashbin_access trim_syscall_is_mountpoint trim_syscall_is_trimacl
  trim_syscall_set/get_external_disk_access trim_syscall_get_posix_mode
近似(只差寄存器/排列): sb_is_system_root.part.0 posixacl_access_permission
  is_user_dir_d is_team_trashbin_dir_and_check_acl_d
  is_team_trashbin_dir_and_get_permission_d trim_syscall_realpath
不一致(语义等价, 差在布局/寄存器/内联决定):
  trim_do_trashbin 286/285, is_mount_on_vol_d 160/159,
  trim_syscall_set_ro_stat 78/77, faccessat 185/185, get_perm 140/139,
  may_delete 135/134, get_trimacl_xattr 112/113: 基本块顺序、寄存器分配
  posixacl_access_permission_check_vol 256/237, posixacl_get_permission 472/423:
    尾部复制和寄存器分配不同
  posixacl_access_permission_check 33/123, trim_access 47/28,
  trim_access_delete 111/73, 缺 posixacl_access_permission_check.part.0:
    飞牛把 check 的头部(is_vol 分派)内联进 trim_access/trim_access_delete,
    主体留在 .part.0; 我们的 gcc IPA 先把 .part.0 内联回头部, 头部
    就超过 max-inline-insns-auto 不再内联进调用方。改写多种头部形状都
    不变, 逻辑一致。
导出与飞牛一致 (get_permission is_trimacl is_vol is_vol_d trim_access
trim_access_delete trim_do_trashbin trim_is_on_trashbin_whitelist 为
EXPORT_SYMBOL, 其余不导出)。

